@step Export the verified revision to a local fichero-BOE.
@static aeat app modelo export --modelo 390 --year 2025 --period 0A --output ./modelo-390-2025.boe
@blocked unconverted Needs the four filed 2025 quarters, which only this page's single-use annual preparation supplies; repeating it refuses because work file rejects an already-presentado revision.
@step After you upload at the portal, record the local filed marker.
@static aeat app modelo work file --modelo 390 --year 2025 --period 0A
@blocked unconverted Needs the four filed 2025 quarters, which only this page's single-use annual preparation supplies; repeating it refuses because work file rejects an already-presentado revision.
@step Reconcile the justificante against the filed record.
@static aeat app modelo reconcile import --modelo 390 --year 2025 --period 0A --file ./390-2025-justificante.pdf
@blocked operator-artifact Needs a real AEAT justificante PDF carrying a CSV; the bundled annex specimens carry none.
